%% Claim state machine. REJECTION states are pre-adjudication; DENIAL is post-adjudication.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> Validating: submit for validation
    Validating --> ValidationFailed: local schema/rule error
    ValidationFailed --> Draft: correct
    Validating --> Validated: all edits pass
    Validated --> EDIGenerated: approve + generate X12
    EDIGenerated --> Submitted: enqueue processing job

    Submitted --> TA1Rejected: envelope invalid (REJECTION)
    Submitted --> TA1Accepted
    TA1Accepted --> Ack999Rejected: syntax/IG error (REJECTION)
    TA1Accepted --> Ack999Accepted
    Ack999Accepted --> Ack277CARejected: claim data error (REJECTION)
    Ack999Accepted --> Ack277CAAccepted

    Ack277CAAccepted --> AcceptedForAdjudication
    AcceptedForAdjudication --> Adjudicating
    Adjudicating --> Paid: covered (8 of 10)
    Adjudicating --> PartiallyPaid: reduced
    Adjudicating --> Denied: post-adjudication denial (2 of 10)

    Paid --> Remit835Received
    PartiallyPaid --> Remit835Received
    Remit835Received --> EFTMatched
    EFTMatched --> Posted
    Posted --> Closed

    Denied --> CorrectedResubmitted: appeal / fix
    Ack277CARejected --> CorrectedResubmitted
    Ack999Rejected --> CorrectedResubmitted
    TA1Rejected --> CorrectedResubmitted
    CorrectedResubmitted --> Draft
    Closed --> [*]

    note right of TA1Rejected
      REJECTIONS (pre-adjudication):
      never counted as denials
    end note
    note right of Denied
      DENIALS (post-adjudication):
      show rule_id + CARC/RARC + next action
      no EFT deposit matched
    end note
